  "takeaways": [
    "TTFT tracks prefill + scheduling + any KV fetch; it separates from decode once batching kicks in.",
    "At N>1, TTFT and TBT are distributions — report samples or boxplots, not only cell means.",
    "Report p95/max (or box whiskers) alongside medians; do not use aggregate tok/s alone.",
    "KV bytes grow ~linearly with seq_len; PagedAttention changes allocation, not the information-theoretic footprint at full context."
